seg-50457327734e = <b>Source commit.</b> The engine records the commit only if it was built with the <c1/> environment variable set, read at compile time:

# text
seg-3c7ed74729d3 = A build without it reports the commit as not recorded, and the engine version identifies the release. Nothing is guessed.

# text
seg-86ff67531a0e = <b>Platform.</b> Operating system, architecture and family of the build. Results are byte-identical on one platform; across platforms floating-point results may differ in the last digits (see <a1>REPRODUCIBILITY.md</a1>).

