seg-995ad516f5ae = Same scenario bytes, seed and engine build give a byte-identical <c1/> and <c2/>. The report carries no timestamp. The only clock reading in the whole crate is the one <c3/> makes, which stamps <c4/> into the result document; the report then shows that stamp and says it is the one field a reproduction will not match. To avoid it, run without <c5/>. <c6/> builds the report of every scenario file under <c7/> (the suite manifest aside) twice, and re-runs six scenarios (among them one campaign of each of the chain, sweep and compose modes) to check this end to end.

