seg-9d9af39942a7 = <c1/> has <c2/> and <c3/>, then <c4/> and <c5/> and one key per section: <c6/>, <c7/>, <c8/>, <c9/> (campaigns and sweeps only), <c10/>, <c11/>, <c12/>, <c13/> (section 3b: <c14/>, <c15/> and <c16/>) and <c17/>. A list section has <c18/>, <c19/> (the rows the page cap left out; the result document carries every value) and, when <c20/> is empty, a <c21/> saying why. A value keeps its raw JSON form in <c22/> and the text the page shows in <c23/>; a missing value is <c24/> in <c25/> and "no value" in <c26/>.

